From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:33:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 28/32] BlueOS: wallpaper look, live weather and equalizer on
 the wallpaper
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ImageWallpaper draws the home / lock look itself (pre-blurred, dimmed
  hardware bitmaps; BlueOSWallpaperWeather) with the AOSP weather effects
  over it, cross-fading lock <-> home; no launcher / shade blur floor.
- Live weather pauses while the home screen moves (offsets / zoom) and
  draws the slow effects at 15 fps: launcher late frames 68 % -> 1-2 %.
- «Эквалайзер на обоях»: bars / wave / glow from below, «Волна под
  часами», «Нимб в такт музыке» (BlueOSMusicPulse, BlueOSBeat).
- The lock clock's live halo stops while the lock screen is hidden and
  reads its settings twice a second, not every frame.
- Fresh phones get every BlueOS switch as the user set them up
  (BlueOSDefaults writes BlueOSSettings' table).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I5e98a5bbaee53eb6b3c9a2c78956b75a430bec5d
